ASS**. My teammate has control after playing ♣2, which the Landlord couldn\'t beat. By passing, my teammate gets a free play and can choose the best combination to either go out or create a favorable situation. I need to preserve my RedJoker because after using it, I\'d only have ♥7 and ♦10 - both weak cards that the Landlord could easily beat with their remaining 2 cards. It\'s better to trust my teammate\'s control and keep my strongest card as backup insurance.\n\n## Answer:\n\n{"cards": []}'}
